        "comments": "The assembly drAntSylv1.hap1.1 is based on 46x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and plastid genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Some haplotypic inversions were detected on: Chromosome 1 from 11.40 to 27.25, Chromosome 2 from 110.36 to 114.36, Chromosome 3 from 49.35 to 66.17 and Chromosome 5 from 117.51 to 141.69 Mbp. The order and orientation of the scaffolds on Chromosome 7 from the start to 19.35 Mbp are uncertain.",
